### 4️⃣ Visual guard (optional UX)

In your pages that have both free and pro sections, you can still conditionally render:

```tsx
{session?.user?.app_metadata?.role === 'pro' ? <ProComponent /> : <FreeComponent />}
```

This is only for nicer UI; the real gate is the API/database check.

